.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
A lexer for the Fennel programming language\&.

Fennel compiles to Lua, so all the Lua builtins are recognized as well
as the special forms that are particular to the Fennel compiler\&.

.fi
.PP
 
